  "description": "The Greek myDATA v1.0.11 and Digital Customer Base v1.0 provided by AADE are in a single dll. Get full control and support from myDATA and the Digital Customer Base. \n\tIt offers a number of simple tools that make creating apps that support myDATA and Digital Customer Base simple and quick.",
