  "releaseNotes": "A. Class SendInvoices\n\t\t1. The field purchaseOrderReference has been added into the extraDetails Structure.\n\t\n\tB. Class RequestE3Info\n\t\t1. The method getE3Info now ignores any duplicate entries returned by AADE.\n\t\t2. The optional parameter \"sumE3\" has been added into the method getE3Info.\n\t\n\tC. The Class CancelDeliveryNote has been added.\n\t\n\tD. Class myDATATools\n\t\t1. The method getVatExemptionCategory returns the new values of version 1.0.11 of myDATA.\n\t\t2. The method get getMovePurpose returns the new values of version 1.0.11 of myDATA. Options 6, 15-18 has been removed in version 1.0.11\n\t\t3. The method getFuelCode has been added.\n\t\t4. The method getspecialInvoiceCategory returns the new values of version 1.0.11 of myDATA.",
